@@@ FILE CTR-Q09-01
---
folder: 06_contracts
format: pdf
title: Ontslagbrief met opzegging – Emma Vandenberghe (31/08/2026)
doc_type: dismissal_letter
author: Tom Verhaegen
author_role: HR Business Partner
date: 2026-08-31
jurisdiction: BE
language: nl
themes: [T5, T1]
